---
// Studi kasus rekayasa sistem web nyata Dimaz Devriza
---

<section id="case-studies" class="py-24 relative">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="mb-16 reveal-on-scroll opacity-0 translate-y-8">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700/60 text-xs font-mono text-accent mb-3">
        <span>REKAYASA SISTEM PRODUKSI</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-4">
        Studi Kasus Sistem Produksi
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-base max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Sistem web nyata yang dirancang untuk kebutuhan operasional perusahaan dan institusi. Karena sistem ini mengelola data internal perusahaan, studi kasus ini berfokus pada arsitektur, penanganan konkurensi, dan solusi rekayasa perangkat lunak.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-16">

      <!-- Studi Kasus 1: D'Royal Village Sistem Logistik & Biaya Proyek -->
      <article class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-card border border-card-border hover:border-slate-700 transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl reveal-on-scroll opacity-0 translate-y-8">
        
        <!-- Header row -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
          <div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-2">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/30">
                Sistem Enterprise Internal
              </span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700/60">
                Padang, Indonesia
              </span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700/60">
                Jan 2026 - Okt 2026
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
              D'Royal Village: Sistem Logistik & Pengendalian Biaya Proyek
            </h3>
          </div>
          
          <div class="text-right">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold border border-emerald-500/20">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
              Aktif Digunakan Perusahaan
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Merancang, membangun, dan men-deploy Sistem Informasi Logistik dan Pengendalian Biaya Proyek berbasis web untuk developer perumahan D'Royal Village. Menggantikan proses manual dan spreadsheet Excel dengan sistem multi-gudang dan multi-cluster terpadu.
        </p>

        <!-- Technical Deep-Dive Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8">
          
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"></path>
              </svg>
              ACID & Konkurensi Pesimistik
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Mengimplementasikan transaksi database dengan proteksi pessimistic locking (<code class="text-sky-300 font-mono">lockForUpdate()</code>) pada batch stok material. Mencegah terjadinya race condition dan stok minus ketika beberapa pengawas gudang mencatat alokasi material secara simultan.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
              </svg>
              Stok Berbasis Batch & Beban Unit Rumah
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Pelacakan nilai stok material dihitung per batch harga pembelian. Pembebanan material dicatat langsung ke masing-masing unit rumah, memungkinkan manajemen memantau perbandingan RAB rencana dengan realisasi fisik lapangan secara real-time.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"></path>
              </svg>
              Manajemen Alat Kerja & Alat Berat
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Siklus peminjaman alat kerja proyek disertai verifikasi status fisik saat pengembalian (kondisi baik, rusak, hilang). Pencatatan beban biaya sewa alat berat dan operasional cluster dilengkapi arsip nota digital.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"></path>
              </svg>
              Hak Akses Multi-Peran (RBAC)
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Matriks otorisasi peran terpisah untuk staf Logistik, Pengawas Lapangan, Manajemen Keuangan, dan Administrator, menjamin kepatuhan audit data dan integritas finansial proyek.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Diagram Alur Arsitektur Konkurensi -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/90 overflow-hidden mb-6">
          <div class="px-4 py-2.5 bg-slate-900/90 border-b border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <div class="flex gap-1.5" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500/80 inline-block"></span>
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/80 inline-block"></span>
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80 inline-block"></span>
              </div>
              <span class="ml-2 font-semibold text-slate-300">Arsitektur: Alur Transaksi ACID & Kontrol Konkurensi</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 hidden sm:inline">Logika Database Produksi</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 font-mono text-xs text-slate-300 overflow-x-auto">
            <div class="min-w-[600px] flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
              
              <!-- Langkah 1 -->
              <div class="flex-1 p-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-center">
                <span class="text-[10px] text-accent block mb-1">LANGKAH 01</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-white block">Permintaan Stok</span>
                <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Pengawas input alokasi batch ke unit rumah</span>
              </div>

              <div class="text-slate-600 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</div>

              <!-- Langkah 2 -->
              <div class="flex-1 p-3 rounded-lg bg-sky-950/40 border border-sky-800/60 text-center">
                <span class="text-[10px] text-sky-400 block mb-1">LANGKAH 02: PENGUNCIAN</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-sky-200 block">lockForUpdate()</span>
                <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-300">Pessimistic lock pada baris batch</span>
              </div>

              <div class="text-slate-600 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</div>

              <!-- Langkah 3 -->
              <div class="flex-1 p-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-center">
                <span class="text-[10px] text-accent block mb-1">LANGKAH 03</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-white block">Validasi Kuantitas</span>
                <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Pengecekan stok fisik vs kuota sisa</span>
              </div>

              <div class="text-slate-600 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</div>

              <!-- Langkah 4 -->
              <div class="flex-1 p-3 rounded-lg bg-emerald-950/40 border border-emerald-800/60 text-center">
                <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-400 block mb-1">LANGKAH 04</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-emerald-200 block">Commit Transaksi</span>
                <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-300">Biaya dicatat ke RAB Unit & Mutasi disimpan</span>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tech Stack Pill Badges -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800/80">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mr-2">Teknologi Utama:</span>
          {["Laravel 11", "Livewire", "Alpine.js", "Tailwind CSS", "MySQL", "Git", "Pessimistic Locking", "RBAC"].map((tag) => (
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700/50">
              {tag}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>

      </article>


      <!-- Studi Kasus 2: LMS SMA Negeri 15 Padang -->
      <article class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-card border border-card-border hover:border-slate-700 transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl reveal-on-scroll opacity-0 translate-y-8">
        
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
          <div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-2">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-300 border border-blue-500/30">
                Sektor Pendidikan
              </span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700/60">
                Padang, Indonesia
              </span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700/60">
                Mar 2026 - Jul 2026
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
              SMA Negeri 15 Padang: Learning Management System (LMS)
            </h3>
          </div>
          
          <div class="text-right">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold border border-emerald-500/20">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
              Aktif Digunakan Sekolah
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Berkolaborasi dengan satu rekan pengembang merancang, membangun, dan men-deploy Learning Management System (LMS) berbasis web untuk guru dan siswa di SMA Negeri 15 Padang. Sistem ini telah sukses diluncurkan dan digunakan secara aktif dalam kegiatan belajar mengajar sekolah.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-2">
              Pengembangan Kolaboratif
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Kolaborasi tim dengan Git version control, manajemen percabangan yang terstruktur, dan pembagian modul aplikasi antara kurikulum dan penilaian.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-2">
              Distribusi Materi & Penugasan
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Distribusi materi pembelajaran digital, pengumpulan tugas siswa dengan verifikasi format file, dan rekapitulasi penilaian otomatis untuk para guru.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-2">
              Deployment Git ke Hosting
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Mengelola konfigurasi hosting dan alur deployment menggunakan Git pada infrastruktur Rumahweb, menjaga uptime dan pemeliharaan server secara teratur.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800/80">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mr-2">Teknologi Utama:</span>
          {["Laravel", "PHP", "MySQL", "Tailwind CSS", "Git", "Hosting Rumahweb", "Deployment Server"].map((tag) => (
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700/50">
              {tag}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>

      </article>


      <!-- Studi Kasus 3: LLDIKTI X SiLAB -->
      <article class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-card border border-card-border hover:border-slate-700 transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl reveal-on-scroll opacity-0 translate-y-8">
        
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
          <div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-2">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-300 border border-purple-500/30">
                Magang Instansi Pemerintah
              </span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700/60">
                Padang, Indonesia
              </span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700/60">
                Jun 2025 - Okt 2025
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
              LLDIKTI Wilayah X: SiLAB (Sistem Pembookingan Laboratorium)
            </h3>
          </div>
          
          <div class="text-right">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-700/60 text-slate-300 text-xs font-semibold border border-slate-600/40">
              Selesai & Dievaluasi
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Selama melaksanakan magang di Kantor LLDIKTI Wilayah X, bertugas memelihara, memperbaiki, dan mengembangkan Sistem Informasi Pembookingan Pemakaian Laboratorium (SiLAB). Menyempurnakan pendaftaran pengguna, validasi berkas persyaratan, serta alur verifikasi pemesanan oleh admin.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-2">
              Efisiensi Alur Verifikasi Admin
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Menyederhanakan proses verifikasi dokumen dan penjadwalan laboratorium untuk mencegah tabrakan agenda pemakaian fasilitas antar perguruan tinggi.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-2">
              Pengelolaan Dokumen Persyaratan
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Membangun fitur unggah dan unduh dokumen administrasi berbasis PDF dengan verifikasi terstruktur demi mendukung efisiensi pelayanan publik.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800/80">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mr-2">Teknologi Utama:</span>
          {["PHP Native", "MySQL", "Bootstrap", "Git", "Verifikasi Dokumen", "Database Relasional"].map((tag) => (
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700/50">
              {tag}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>

      </article>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
